<Style backgroundColor="#ffffff" bodyColor="#ffffff" bodyXPadding="24" bodyYPadding="32" textBaseColor="#17202a" textLinkColor="#ec3750" buttonBodyColor="#ec3750" buttonTextColor="#ffffff" buttonBorderRadius="6" />
<H3 paddingBottom="8">Hack Club</H3>
<H1 paddingBottom="16">Your signature is needed</H1>
<Paragraph fontSize="16" lineHeight="165" paddingBottom="16">Hi {data.cosigner_name},</Paragraph>
<Paragraph fontSize="16" lineHeight="165" paddingBottom="16"><Strong>{data.signer_fullName}</Strong> has signed the Hack Club NDA. Because they're under 18, a parent or guardian needs to sign it too.</Paragraph>
<Paragraph fontSize="16" lineHeight="165" paddingBottom="16">It takes a couple of minutes. This link expires on {data.cosign_expiresOn}.</Paragraph>
<Button paddingTop="8" paddingBottom="24" href="{data.cosign_url}">Review and sign the agreement</Button>
<Paragraph fontSize="13" lineHeight="160" paddingBottom="16">Or paste this link into your browser:<Br />{data.cosign_url}</Paragraph>
<Paragraph fontSize="14" lineHeight="160" paddingBottom="8">This link is just for you, so please don't forward it. Weren't expecting this? You can ignore it. Nothing happens unless you sign.</Paragraph>
<Divider paddingTop="16" paddingBottom="16" />
<Paragraph fontSize="12" lineHeight="170"><Strong>The Hack Foundation</Strong>, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit<Br />212 Battery St., Shelburne, VT 05401, USA<Br />This message concerns a legal agreement. Keep it for your records.</Paragraph>
